        "text": "### Page\n- Page URL: http://localhost:6063/?view=panorama\n- Page Title: Lovable App\n- Console: 1 errors, 2 warnings\n### Snapshot\n```yaml\n- generic [ref=e2]:\n  - region \"Notifications (F8)\":\n    - list\n  - region \"Notifications alt+T\"\n  - generic [ref=e378]:\n    - banner [ref=e379]:\n      - generic [ref=e380]:\n        - link \"遗 华夏非遗 Chinese Intangible Heritage\" [ref=e381] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /\n          - generic [ref=e383]: 遗\n          - generic [ref=e384]:\n            - heading \"华夏非遗\" [level=1] [ref=e385]\n            - paragraph [ref=e386]: Chinese Intangible Heritage\n        - navigation [ref=e387]:\n          - link \"首页\" [ref=e388] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /\n          - link \"全景探索\" [ref=e389] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /?view=panorama\n          - link \"分类浏览\" [ref=e390] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"#categories\"\n        - link \"开始探索\" [ref=e392] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /?view=panorama\n    - main [ref=e393]:\n      - generic [ref=e394]:\n        - generic [ref=e395]:\n          - generic [ref=e396]:\n            - heading \"全景探索\" [level=1] [ref=e397]\n            - paragraph [ref=e398]: 拖拽旋转场景，点击热点了解非遗项目\n          - generic [ref=e399]:\n            - generic [ref=e400]:\n              - button \"苏 苏绣 传统工艺\" [ref=e403] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e404]: 苏\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - paragraph: 苏绣\n                    - paragraph: 传统工艺\n              - button \"京 京剧 传统表演\" [ref=e405] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic [ref=e406]: 京\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - paragraph: 京剧\n                    - paragraph: 传统表演\n            - generic:\n              - paragraph [ref=e408]: 拖拽旋转 • 滚轮缩放 • 点击热点探索\n              - generic [ref=e409]:\n                - button [ref=e410] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - img [ref=e411]\n                - button [ref=e413] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - img [ref=e414]\n            - generic [ref=e416]:\n              - button [ref=e417] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - img [ref=e418]\n              - generic [ref=e420]:\n                - img \"苏绣\" [ref=e421]\n                - generic [ref=e423]: 传统工艺\n              - generic [ref=e424]:\n                - heading \"苏绣\" [level=2] [ref=e425]\n                - paragraph [ref=e426]: Suzhou Embroidery\n                - generic [ref=e427]:\n                  - generic [ref=e428]:\n                    - img [ref=e429]\n                    - text: 江苏 · 江南水乡\n                  - generic [ref=e432]:\n                    - img [ref=e433]\n                    - text: 2006年入选\n                - paragraph [ref=e435]: 苏绣是中国四大名绣之一，以精细雅洁著称，图案秀丽、针法活泼、色彩清雅。\n                - generic [ref=e436]:\n                  - img \"苏绣 1\" [ref=e438]\n                  - img \"苏绣 2\" [ref=e440]\n                  - img \"苏绣 3\" [ref=e442]\n                - generic [ref=e443]:\n                  - link \"查看详情\" [ref=e444] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /heritage/suzhou-embroidery\n                  - button \"继续探索\" [ref=e445] [cursor=pointer]\n        - generic [ref=e447]:\n          - generic [ref=e448]:\n            - heading \"非遗项目\" [level=2] [ref=e449]\n            - paragraph [ref=e450]: 探索中国丰富多彩的非物质文化遗产，感受千年传承的文化魅力\n          - generic [ref=e451]:\n            - textbox \"搜索非遗项目...\" [ref=e453]\n            - combobox [ref=e454] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic: 全部类别\n              - img [ref=e455]\n            - combobox [ref=e457] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic: 全部地区\n              - img [ref=e458]\n            - combobox [ref=e460] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic: 按名称\n              - img [ref=e461]\n          - paragraph [ref=e463]: 共 8 个非遗项目\n          - generic [ref=e464]:\n            - generic [ref=e465]:\n              - generic [ref=e466]:\n                - img \"春节\" [ref=e467]\n                - generic [ref=e469]: 民俗活动\n                - generic [ref=e470]:\n                  - heading \"春节\" [level=3] [ref=e471]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e472]: Spring Festival\n              - generic [ref=e473]:\n                - generic [ref=e474]:\n                  - img [ref=e475]\n                  - generic [ref=e478]: 北京 · 华夏大地\n                - paragraph [ref=e479]: 春节是中国最重要的传统节日，承载着团圆、祈福、辞旧迎新等丰富的文化内涵。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e480] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/spring-festival\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e481]\n            - generic [ref=e483]:\n              - generic [ref=e484]:\n                - img \"端午龙舟\" [ref=e485]\n                - generic [ref=e487]: 民俗活动\n                - generic [ref=e488]:\n                  - heading \"端午龙舟\" [level=3] [ref=e489]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e490]: Dragon Boat Racing\n              - generic [ref=e491]:\n                - generic [ref=e492]:\n                  - img [ref=e493]\n                  - generic [ref=e496]: 广东 · 楚地遗风\n                - paragraph [ref=e497]: 龙舟竞渡是端午节最具代表性的民俗活动，承载着对屈原的纪念和对美好生活的祈愿。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e498] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/dragon-boat\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e499]\n            - generic [ref=e501]:\n              - generic [ref=e502]:\n                - img \"剪纸\" [ref=e503]\n                - generic [ref=e505]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e506]:\n                  - heading \"剪纸\" [level=3] [ref=e507]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e508]: Paper Cutting\n              - generic [ref=e509]:\n                - generic [ref=e510]:\n                  - img [ref=e511]\n                  - generic [ref=e514]: 陕西 · 黄土高原\n                - paragraph [ref=e515]: 剪纸是中国最古老的民间艺术之一，用剪刀或刻刀在纸上剪刻花纹，寓意吉祥美好。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e516] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/paper-cutting\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e517]\n            - generic [ref=e519]:\n              - generic [ref=e520]:\n                - img \"京剧\" [ref=e521]\n                - generic [ref=e523]: 传统表演\n                - generic [ref=e524]:\n                  - heading \"京剧\" [level=3] [ref=e525]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e526]: Peking Opera\n              - generic [ref=e527]:\n                - generic [ref=e528]:\n                  - img [ref=e529]\n                  - generic [ref=e532]: 北京 · 京城古韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e533]: 京剧是中国影响最大的戏曲剧种，被誉为\"国粹\"，以唱念做打的表演方式闻名于世。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e534] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/peking-opera\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e535]\n            - generic [ref=e537]:\n              - generic [ref=e538]:\n                - img \"昆曲\" [ref=e539]\n                - generic [ref=e541]: 传统表演\n                - generic [ref=e542]:\n                  - heading \"昆曲\" [level=3] [ref=e543]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e544]: Kunqu Opera\n              - generic [ref=e545]:\n                - generic [ref=e546]:\n                  - img [ref=e547]\n                  - generic [ref=e550]: 江苏 · 姑苏雅韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e551]: 昆曲是中国最古老的戏曲剧种之一，被誉为\"百戏之祖\"，以典雅细腻的表演著称。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e552] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/kunqu-opera\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e553]\n            - generic [ref=e555]:\n              - generic [ref=e556]:\n                - img \"书法\" [ref=e557]\n                - generic [ref=e559]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e560]:\n                  - heading \"书法\" [level=3] [ref=e561]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e562]: Chinese Calligraphy\n              - generic [ref=e563]:\n                - generic [ref=e564]:\n                  - img [ref=e565]\n                  - generic [ref=e568]: 安徽 · 神州墨韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e569]: 书法是中国特有的艺术形式，以毛笔书写汉字，融合了文字、绘画与哲学的精髓。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e570] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/chinese-calligraphy\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e571]\n            - generic [ref=e573]:\n              - generic [ref=e574]:\n                - img \"苏绣\" [ref=e575]\n                - generic [ref=e577]: 传统工艺\n                - generic [ref=e578]:\n                  - heading \"苏绣\" [level=3] [ref=e579]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e580]: Suzhou Embroidery\n              - generic [ref=e581]:\n                - generic [ref=e582]:\n                  - img [ref=e583]\n                  - generic [ref=e586]: 江苏 · 江南水乡\n                - paragraph [ref=e587]: 苏绣是中国四大名绣之一，以精细雅洁著称，图案秀丽、针法活泼、色彩清雅。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e588] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/suzhou-embroidery\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e589]\n            - generic [ref=e591]:\n              - generic [ref=e592]:\n                - img \"宜兴紫砂\" [ref=e593]\n                - generic [ref=e595]: 传统工艺\n                - generic [ref=e596]:\n                  - heading \"宜兴紫砂\" [level=3] [ref=e597]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e598]: Yixing Purple Clay\n              - generic [ref=e599]:\n                - generic [ref=e600]:\n                  - img [ref=e601]\n                  - generic [ref=e604]: 江苏 · 太湖之滨\n                - paragraph [ref=e605]: 宜兴紫砂壶以独特的紫砂泥料制成，造型古朴典雅，是中国传统茶文化的重要载体。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e606] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/yixing-teapot\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e607]\n    - contentinfo [ref=e609]:\n      - generic [ref=e610]:\n        - generic [ref=e611]:\n          - generic [ref=e612]:\n            - generic [ref=e613]:\n              - generic [ref=e615]: 遗\n              - heading \"华夏非遗\" [level=3] [ref=e617]\n            - paragraph [ref=e618]: 致力于保护和传承中国非物质文化遗产，让千年文化在数字时代焕发新的生机。\n          - generic [ref=e619]:\n            - heading \"探索分类\" [level=4] [ref=e620]\n            - list [ref=e621]:\n              - listitem [ref=e622]:\n                - link \"传统工艺\" [ref=e623] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e624]:\n                - link \"传统表演\" [ref=e625] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e626]:\n                - link \"民俗活动\" [ref=e627] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e628]:\n                - link \"传统美术\" [ref=e629] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n          - generic [ref=e630]:\n            - heading \"了解更多\" [level=4] [ref=e631]\n            - list [ref=e632]:\n              - listitem [ref=e633]:\n                - link \"关于我们\" [ref=e634] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#\"\n              - listitem [ref=e635]:\n                - link \"使用指南\" [ref=e636] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#\"\n              - listitem [ref=e637]:\n                - link \"联系方式\" [ref=e638] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#\"\n              - listitem [ref=e639]:\n                - link \"版权声明\" [ref=e640] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#\"\n        - paragraph [ref=e642]: © 2024 华夏非遗. 保护传承，让文化永续流传。\n```"
